        "raw": "<p>I was playing a game today against Advanced Baron Blade using GI Bunker, Visionary, Ra, and Absolute Zero in Insula Primalis. &nbsp;I&#39;m playing while watching TV and not really paying full attention when I notice during the environment turn that BB still has 30 HP (due to a string of poorly timed Mobile Defense Platforms) and 13 cards in his trash. &nbsp;I realize I&#39;m going to have one turn to do 30 damage or I&#39;m going to lose. &nbsp;Luckily the environment flips an Obsidian Field which should help.</p><p>BB plays a Backlash Field and flips the last two cards into his trash. &nbsp;On Bunker&#39;s turn I realize I&#39;m going to need all the help I can get so play Turret Mode even though I only have a Maintenance Unit and Grenade Launcher in play. &nbsp;I use Bunker Buster as my first power (just because) and then hit him with a Grenade Launcher for 4 (BB = 26). &nbsp;On Visionary&#39;s turn I play Psychic Maelstrom for 3 (23) and use Mental Divergence to ditch that pesky Backlash Field. &nbsp;In my head I&#39;m thinking that this isn&#39;t going to go my way. &nbsp;On Ra&#39;s turn (with Staff of Ra in play) I hit BB with an Inferno for 5 (18) and then realize I can hit AZ for another 3 to activate Isothermic Transducer (every little bit helps). &nbsp;Three to AZ becomes 5 to BB who is currently the proud owner of a Twist the Ether (13). &nbsp;A Blazing Tornado later, BB was sitting at 8 HP. &nbsp;</p><p>BB starts AZ&#39;s turn with 8 HP so I&#39;m feeling a little more positive. &nbsp;Impale hits him for 4 (4), and Frost Bound Drain hits him for 5 (-1), causing him to flip and restore to 30. &nbsp;AZ also hits himself for 5 damage with FBD which turns to 7 against the Baron (23). &nbsp;I deal BB another 3 (20) with Thermal Shockwave and heal AZ for 3 also (AZ is at 23). &nbsp;AZ has dealt 19 Cold damage so far in one turn. &nbsp;Thermal Shockwave hits me for 21 Fire which I blast back at Baron for the killing blow. &nbsp;</p><p>I thought I was going to have trouble dealing 30 damage in one round and I ended up dealing 63 damage! &nbsp;I love this game. &nbsp;I know AZ strategies have been well documented at this point, but I really think I want to write an updated guide for him.</p><p>(Full Disclosure: &nbsp;Originally I had somehow left BB at 1 HP and he was about to be killed by a Velociraptor Pack on the environment turn. &nbsp;I quickly paused the game and rewound to the beginning of AZ&#39;s turn to fully document what I did, but I somehow ended up dealing 4 extra damage. &nbsp;I must have done something a little different the first time that I&#39;ll now probably wrack my brain trying to figure out.)</p>",
